# forge clean manifest (DEV-M0-15; forge {{.ForgeVer}})
# `forge clean --check` proposes deletion candidates that match a [scratch]
# pattern and do not match any [managed] pattern.

[scratch]
**/.forge/scratch/**
**/.forge/cache/**
**/*.tmp.*
**/_scratch_*
**/_llm_*
**/*.llm.bak
**/.aider*

[managed]
.gitignore
.gitleaks.toml
.forge/manifest
.forge/specs/**
README.md
LICENSE
go.mod
go.sum
